 "note": "Mutants of tools/ci_light.sh, which decides in the first job of the CI whether a pull request needs all of CI or only the light checks: the files of the light kinds that the skipped jobs read, the kinds themselves, the merge base (the base of the pull request, not main), the output. Each must be noticed by tests/scripts/test_ci_light.py. No build: python3 tools/mutate.py tests/data/ci_light_mutants.json --keep-going --jobs 1, from the repository folder (about 20 seconds for each mutant).",
